// Ensure backup directory exists
Q|Backups
// Read configuration with fallback to None
cfg=J|config.json|&0
// Branch logic based on configuration state
cfg==&0|K|Using fallback|K|Config loaded
// Set test x variable
x=15
// Output state
val=x>10|&h|&l
K|State is:|val
// Write completion status
9|backup.log|OK
// Print completion
K|Done!
